        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(2) Subject to paragraph (4) and with respect to a case described in paragraph (1), any party in interest may request the court to enter an order dismissing the case. If requested, the court shall enter an order of dismissal not later than 7 days after such request."
        },
