        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the court\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"scope_text\":\"Subject to paragraph (4) and with respect to a case described in paragraph (1), if requested by any party in interest.\",\"summary\":\"Subject to paragraph (4) and with respect to a case described in paragraph (1), if a party in interest requests the court to enter an order dismissing the case, the court shall enter an order of dismissal not later than 7 days after such request.\"}",
